{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他真想和对方共享幸福，可对方没给新保证，他怕幸福只属于自己，没法不在意对方会不会选他。\",\n      \"key\": \"没给新保证\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-3\",\n      \"text\": \"少去确认心意，让他关心时安心些，却管不住他还想被珍惜。尽情喜欢曾让他幸福，却不能保证对方选他。\",\n      \"key\": \"不能保证\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他不想把所有不安都交给对方解决，也不愿因怕落空就故意把喜欢压淡。\",\n      \"key\": \"故意把喜欢压淡\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-5\",\n      \"text\": \"他仍盼对方主动靠近、把他放在心上，心里再难受，也不拿这份难受催对方，更不装作自己不在乎。\",\n      \"key\": \"主动靠近\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S12-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S12-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"动摇\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"失效\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S08-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S09-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S08-1\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S10-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-5\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R57\", \"R59\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-1\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"把未着落的地方说具体为在意对方会不会选择自己，并保留对方没有给新保证这一关键原因，让幸福与未满足的愿望同时成立。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R58\", \"R61\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-3\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并并具体化\",\n      \"why\": \"分别保留少确认心意带来的安心及其管不了的渴望、尽情喜欢带来的幸福及其不能保证的选择，明确两种办法各自帮过他什么、又管不了什么。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R60\", \"R62\", \"R63\", \"R64\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-4\", \"S13-5\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并压缩\",\n      \"why\": \"保留不把所有不安交给对方、舍不得压淡感情、仍盼对方靠近却不催迫的具体边界，删去重复宣告冲突与拒绝自欺的总结。前稿单列的“想被珍惜的念头没有消失”已由S13-1和S13-3表达，删去不损失意思。S13-5的跨段箭头改接S10-2，因为那一条明确写出他不想催对方为难，也不假装自己不在乎；S11-2不足以推出这份克制。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "13e02c1f-9f43-4450-b604-0cd6bfb4b4b8", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T202716583166Z", "elapsed_seconds": 218.531, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T20:30:55.115955+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "785613b585626293717fcfd9af7c04ab8c423c1c9bf2d1d8c28f3e18d96ec7ad", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evi